  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Konfigurasi Message Type (Tipe Pesan)",
      "id": "details-message-type",
      "intro": "Sub-tab Message Type pada laci pemetaan CSV memungkinkan pengguna mendaftarkan tipe-tipe endpoint transaksi beserta endpoint value dan kategori pesan. Konfigurasi ini penting untuk menentukan jenis dan arah aliran data CSV yang akan diproses oleh sistem.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Daftar & Detail Message Type",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Daftar message type menampilkan seluruh endpoint yang terdaftar.\n• Setiap entri memiliki informasi:\n  - **Name:** Nama identifikasi message type.\n  - **Value:** Endpoint value atau URL target.\n  - **State:** Kategori arah pesan — AUTH, TRANSACTION, INQUIRY, atau **BULK_TRANSACTION** (khusus CSV).\n• Sidebar endpoint panel menampilkan item dengan aksen warna sesuai state (orange untuk AUTH, blue untuk TRANSACTION, teal untuk INQUIRY).\n• Klik entri untuk melihat detail lengkap, gunakan **Add** untuk menambah entri baru.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border:1px solid #a7f3d0;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f0fdf4;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Message Type</span></div><div style=\"padding:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(16,185,129,.04);border-left:3px solid #10b981;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">CSV_BULK_UPLOAD</span><span style=\"padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(59,130,246,.1);font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#2563eb;\">BULK_TRANSACTION</span></div><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">/api/v1/csv/upload</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid transparent;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;\">CSV_INQUIRY</span><span style=\"padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(20,184,166,.1);font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;color:#14b8a6;\">INQUIRY</span></div><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:2px;\">/api/v1/csv/query</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Form Tambah / Edit Message Type",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\nDrawer form berukuran **560px** menyediakan field berikut:\n1. **Name** *(Wajib)*: Nama identifikasi message type.\n2. **Endpoint Value** *(Wajib)*: URL atau path endpoint tujuan. Ditampilkan dengan ikon link untuk referensi visual.\n3. **Message Type** *(Wajib)*: Kategori arah pesan — pilih dari `AUTH`, `TRANSACTION`, `INQUIRY`, atau `BULK_TRANSACTION`.\n4. **To Time** *(Opsional)*: Nilai timeout dalam milidetik. Masukkan angka positif, minimal 0.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border:1px solid #a7f3d0;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #a7f3d0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#059669;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 007.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 00-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"/><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 00-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 007.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Create Message Type</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Fill details and save changes</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:9.5px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Name <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Enter message type name</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Endpoint Value <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 007.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 00-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"/></svg>Enter endpoint value</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Message Type <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Choose</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">To Time</span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">0</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-top:1px solid #a7f3d0;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#059669;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Create</button></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
